0..72 Comment "// #2687: a workspace is the packages its `workspace.gandr` names, found"
73..146 Comment "// above them. It is not a package: it states what its members share as a"
147..224 Comment "// model of `Gandr.Workspace`, which each member\'s library imports, and names"
225..299 Comment "// its members, each a directory below it rooting a package. `gandr check`"
300..369 Comment "// here checks this source and every member, and writes each member\'s"
370..386 Comment "// `gandr.toml`."
387..461 Comment "// The manifest theories, from the standard library\'s `std.package` by its"
